      "content": "That sounds really powerful. I'm worried though, if we include much about the conflicts or the displacement of the tribes, it might ruin the inspirational tone of the exhibit. Since the focus is on the progress and the building of the nation, shouldn't we just leave those other perspectives out so the narrative stays focused on the success of the expansion?",
